  "content": "<div>\n<div><strong>自 1.3 版本起新增白名單和黑名單功能，使用物品標籤 \"randomore:randomore_blacklist\" 和 \"randomore:randomore_whitelist\"，並在 1.6 版本中基於戰利品表重寫。</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>本模組添加了一種會掉落隨機物品的礦石。同時兼容其他模組。</div>\n<div><img src=\"http://nottouchedgrass.com/files/site/mods/RandomOre/random_ore_nobg.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"><img src=\"http://nottouchedgrass.com/files/site/mods/RandomOre/deepslate_random_ore_nobg.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"http://nottouchedgrass.com/files/site/mods/RandomOre/netherrack_random_ore_nobg.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"><img src=\"http://nottouchedgrass.com/files/site/mods/RandomOre/end_stone_random_ore_nobg.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></div>\n<div>可免費用於整合包！</div>\n</div>",
